# Google Maps Platform API Key for Vue 3 + Vite
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and paste your API key below.
# NEVER commit `.env.local` or hardcode an API key in source files.
#
# Option A — Free Zero-Billing Prototyping (Maps Demo Key):
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card required) and accept the Demo Project Terms.
# 3. Generate/reveal your Demo Key and copy it below.
#    (Note: Daily quota limits apply; not for production use.)
#
# Option B — Production Google Cloud Key:
# 1. Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API, and Elevation API.
# 2. Restrict the key by HTTP Referrer and designated APIs:
#    https://docs.cloud.google.com/api-keys/docs/add-restrictions-api-keys?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
